      GSN FARMA has appointed a Data Protection Officer who can be contacted at <a href="mailto:dpo@gsnfarma.com">dpo@gsnfarma.com</a>.<h2>2. Compliance with applicable regulations</h2>
      GSN FARMA has adapted the Website to the GDPR and LOPDGDD. To do this, it has implemented the policies, means and technical and organizational procedures to guarantee and protect the confidentiality, integrity and availability of its personal data.The transmission of data by the user of GSN FARMA services (hereinafter, the "User") through the Website is carried out voluntarily and with prior information about the use and purposes of the processing.<h2>3. Principles we apply to your personal information</h2>
      Data provided to GSN FARMA through different means, online or offline contact forms or any other procedure used to collect your data will be processed in accordance with applicable data protection regulations, and solely for the purpose of providing the service you have been informed about.In the processing of your personal data, we apply the following principles that comply with GDPR requirements:<ul>
      <li>Principle of lawfulness, fairness and transparency: We will always have a legal basis for processing your personal data for one or more specific purposes that we will inform you about in advance with complete transparency. GSN FARMA informs you that only information necessary to achieve the purpose of processing is collected and only the data you have provided for the purpose(s) you were informed about will be processed.</li>
      <li>Principle of data minimization: We will only request the strictly necessary data in relation to the stated purposes.</li>
      <li>Principle of storage period limitation: Personal data will be retained for the strictly necessary time until the purpose for which they were collected ends and as long as the cause that legitimized the processing of this personal data is maintained. Once the cause that legitimized the processing has ended, personal data will be retained properly locked for the prescription period of actions that could arise from the relationship maintained between the parties and/or the legally established retention periods.</li>
      <li>Principle of integrity: Your data will be processed in such a way as to guarantee adequate security of personal data and ensure confidentiality. You should know that we take all necessary precautions to prevent unauthorized access or misuse of data by third parties.</li>
      <li>Principle of confidentiality: GSN FARMA, as the data controller, guarantees confidentiality in the processing of all personal data of the User to which it has access. The data controller, as well as any other person involved in any phase of processing, is subject to the strictest professional secrecy, with a special commitment to adopt the necessary levels of protection and measures, both technical and organizational, to guarantee the security of personal data and prevent its alteration, misuse, loss, theft, processing or unauthorized access.</li>
      <li>Principle of data accuracy: All information provided by the User to GSN FARMA must be truthful and the User will be solely responsible for false or inaccurate statements and for any damage caused to GSN FARMA or to third parties.</li>
      </ul>
      GSN FARMA reserves the right to exclude from services any User who has provided false data, without prejudice to other legal actions that may apply.<h2>4. Processing of personal data</h2>
      4.1. Collection and processing of personal dataBy providing your data through the Website or any other means, the User guarantees that this data is true, accurate, complete and up to date, and assumes responsibility for any direct or indirect damage or loss that could result from failure to comply with this obligation.If you provide GSN FARMA with data of third parties, the User must have their consent and commit to transfer them the information contained in this Policy, exempting GSN FARMA from any responsibility in this regard. However, GSN FARMA may carry out verifications to confirm this fact, adopting the due diligence measures that correspond, in accordance with data protection regulations.<br />4.2. Purposes of processingThe purposes of the processing that GSN FARMA carries out of the User's personal data are:<table>
