      <tr><td><strong>Use of cookies</strong></td><td>Analyze user navigation and ensure the proper functioning of the Website.</td><td>Consent of the interested party.</td><td>Depending on the cookie duration. See <a href="/en/cookie-policy">Cookies Policy</a> at the bottom of the Website.</td></tr>
