      Personal data collected belong to the following categories of interested parties: Website User.Regarding inquiries or requests made through the data collection forms available on the Website, Users are allowed to briefly explain the reason for their inquiry or contact. Please note that GSN FARMA will not respond to any personal inquiries, except those strictly established by applicable legislation. Under no circumstances should the User communicate data of special categories (for example: health data, religion, etc.) through the forms enabled on the Website. If you do so, the User exempts GSN FARMA from all responsibility. If inappropriate inquiries or content are submitted, GSN FARMA will proceed to delete them.<br />4.4. Automated individual decision-making, including profilingNo automated individual decision-making, including profiling, is envisaged.<h2>5. Processing of data by third parties and transfer</h2>
      Depending on the purposes for which personal data is collected, your personal data may be processed by:<ul>
      <li>Authorized personnel of GSN FARMA or its representatives acting on its behalf, subject to applicable data protection regulations.</li>
      <li>Administrations, Authorities and Public Bodies, including Courts and Tribunals, when required by applicable regulations.</li>
      <li>External service providers contracted by GSN FARMA who have the status of data processor [IT service providers who process information, data storage, database support maintenance, mailing, software and applications]. All this only after carrying out the necessary measures to ensure we can share this information and after having signed a data processing agreement with our processors, in compliance with data protection regulations.</li>
      </ul>
      If there is a sale, merger, consolidation, change in corporate control, substantial asset transfer, reorganization or liquidation of GSN FARMA, at our discretion, we may transfer, sell or assign information collected on the Website to one or more relevant parties.<h2>6. Security measures</h2>
      GSN FARMA adopts the levels of security required by the GDPR appropriate to the nature of the data being processed at any given time for its activity. In this regard, it uses encryption techniques that do not allow a third party to trace the identity of the User interacting with our services. Likewise, it may also carry out secure anonymization techniques of the personal data it processes to carry out its activity. However, technical security in a medium like the Internet is not impregnable and there may be malicious acts by third parties, although GSN FARMA provides you with the means to prevent such acts.<h2>7. International data transfer</h2>
      We do not transfer User's personal data to third parties outside the European Union. In the event that international data transfers are carried out, all appropriate technical and organizational measures will be taken to guarantee data security.<h2>8. Rights of interested parties and their exercise</h2>
      In accordance with the GDPR and LOPDGDD, Users can exercise the following rights:<ul>
      <li>Right of access: The User may ask GSN FARMA if it is processing your data and, if so, access to it.</li>
      <li>Right to rectification: The User may request correction of data if it is inaccurate or incomplete.</li>
      <li>Right to request deletion of your data, when possible. In any case, when the User exercises this right, all personal data linked to their account, as well as the information and content that integrates their profile, will be deactivated and will remain blocked until the legal period expires.</li>
      <li>Right to request limitation of its processing: In this case we will only keep it for the exercise or defense of claims.</li>
      <li>Right to object to processing: GSN FARMA will stop processing personal data, with the exception that it must continue to be processed for reasons of overriding legitimate interest or for the exercise or defense of possible claims.</li>
      <li>Right to data portability: If the User wants their data to be processed by another data controller, GSN FARMA will facilitate the transfer of their data to the new controller if both have the technical means necessary for this.</li>
      <li>Right not to be subject to a decision based solely on automated processing of your personal data.</li>
      <li>Right to withdraw consent: If the User has given consent for a specific purpose, they may withdraw it at any time, without affecting the lawfulness of processing based on consent prior to its withdrawal.</li>
      <li>Right to file a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Authority: If you believe that a violation of data protection legislation has occurred regarding the processing of your personal data (<a href="http://www.aepd.es">www.aepd.es</a>).</li>
      </ul>
      To exercise your rights, you can use the models and forms available on the official page of the Spanish Data Protection Authority (<a href="https://www.aepd.es/es/derechos-y-deberes/conoce-tus-derechos">https://www.aepd.es/es/derechos-y-deberes/conoce-tus-derechos</a>), and contact GSN FARMA in writing at its address or by email to <a href="mailto:dpo@gsnfarma.com">dpo@gsnfarma.com</a>, REF: "Data Protection".<h2>9. User consent</h2>
      The User declares that they have read and expressly accepted this Privacy Policy, when the legal basis for processing is their consent. You may withdraw consent at any time. Withdrawal of consent will not affect the lawfulness of processing prior to its withdrawal.The User is obliged to keep GSN FARMA indemnified against any possible claim, fine or sanction that may be required to bear as a consequence of the User's failure to comply with the duty described in this paragraph.<h2>10. Links to other websites</h2>
      This Website contains links or links to other websites not managed by GSN FARMA, so GSN FARMA does not exercise any control over these, nor is it responsible for the information they provide access to. We ask you to visit these websites directly to obtain information about their privacy policy, which provides information about the protection of your data, security, data collection and provisions relating to data transmission.If you follow us on our social networks, review their privacy policies for information about how they treat and share your personal data, as GSN FARMA does not exercise any control over them nor has any responsibility regarding the information these websites provide access to.<h2>11. Changes to privacy policy</h2>
      We will only use personal data as established in the Privacy Policy that is in force at the time such data is collected.GSN FARMA reserves the right to modify this Privacy Policy at any time with effect from the date of publication of such modifications on the Website, so it is recommended that you visit it each time you access it. In any case, if at any time we decide to process personal data differently than what was declared at the time of collection, we will inform the User of this, collecting their consent if necessary.If any clause of this Privacy Policy is annulled or considered null, the rest of the conditions will not be affected, fully retaining their validity and effectiveness, in accordance with applicable regulations in force at any given time.<h2>12. Applicable law</h2>
      The privacy of all information provided, both by the User through the different personal data request forms and that accessible through the Website, is governed by applicable data protection regulations, in particular, by the GDPR and LOPDGDD.<h2>13. Cookies</h2>
      Access to the Website may involve the use of cookies. Cookies are small amounts of information that are stored in the browser used by each user so that the server remembers certain information that may subsequently be used. This information allows you to be identified as a specific user and allows you to save your personal preferences, as well as technical information about the use and operability of the Website.For more information, you can consult our <a href="/en/cookie-policy">Cookies Policy</a> at the bottom of the Website.
